@startuml SEQ_13_MENGELOLA_SERTIFIKAT
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-13: Mengelola Sertifikat Praktikum

actor       "Admin / Asisten"               as User
boundary    "Browser"                        as Browser
control     "PraktikumSertifikatController"  as Controller
participant "CertificateService"             as Service
entity      "SertifikatPraktikum Model"      as Model

== Lihat Halaman Sertifikat ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka menu "Sertifikat" di halaman praktikum
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/sertifikat
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : Query sertifikat berdasarkan praktikum
Model --> Controller   : Data sertifikat
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman sertifikat
Browser    --> User    : Halaman sertifikat + preview template + daftar sertifikat

== Upload Template Sertifikat ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Upload Template", pilih kategori (praktikum/aslab), pilih file .docx
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/{id}/sertifikat/template {kategori, file}
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Preview template ter-update

== Generate Sertifikat ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Generate Sertifikat", pilih target (praktikan/aslab/all)
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/{id}/sertifikat/generate {target, user_ids?}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Service  : generate(templatePath, placeholders) per user
Service --> Controller : path file sertifikat
Controller -> Model    : create per user\n({praktikum_id, user_id, kategori, file_path})
Model --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Daftar sertifikat ter-refresh

@enduml